{"version":1,"content":"<p>這家全球最大晶圓代工廠周二公佈，10 月營收達到 5868.9 億新台幣（折合 178.8 億美元），同比增長 59.7%，環比上月上漲 14.7%。各大科技企業持續在人工智能領域大舉投入，先進半導體需求火熱，令台積電從中受益。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585774.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.972913+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:56:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"41b3d6591f0b5f5f87d47c8efb401c1ab940f4cf3cd7e74ddb7959d7e60cba24","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}